</div></div>
<div>
<div class="celebrate">🎉🏆🎉</div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、恭喜你！完成 P3 下學期！</div>
<div class="cert">
<div class="cert-title">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--gray);margin:8px 0;">特此證明</div>
<div class="cert-body">
<strong style="font-size:18px;">＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿</strong> 同學<br/>
完成 <strong>小三下學期數學全課程（L21-L40）</strong><br/>
共 20 堂 · 約 750 題練習 · 掌握 50+ 個Trap辨識技巧<br/>
由Multiplication進階到可能性入門<br/>
由棒形圖閱讀到Symmetry初探<br/>
<strong>We don't teach math — we teach trap avoidance.！</strong>
</div>
<div class="cert-seal">🪤 Trap大師認證</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h1">二、P3 下學期學咗咩？</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin:8px 0;font-size:12px;">
<div class="grade-badge gold">數與運算<br/>L21-L24</div>
<div class="grade-badge blue">Fraction與Decimal<br/>L25-L27</div>
<div class="grade-badge green">圖表與測量<br/>L28-L30</div>
<div class="grade-badge gold">容量與時間<br/>L31-L33</div>
<div class="grade-badge blue">圖形與空間<br/>L34,L36,L37</div>
<div class="grade-badge green">數感與概率<br/>L35,L38</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;margin-top:8px;">
✅ 三位數Multiplication ✅ 有餘數Division ✅ 四則混合次序 ✅ 同分母Fraction加減<br/>
✅ FractionWord Problems ✅ Decimal十分位 ✅ 棒形圖閱讀+製作 ✅ 測量+數據<br/>
✅ L-mL轉換 ✅ 時間60進制 ✅ 3D Solid面棱頂點 ✅ 方向和位置<br/>
✅ 軸Symmetry ✅ 可能性判斷 ✅ 快速心算 ✅ Estimation驗證
</div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、P3 最易錯Trap TOP 5（一定要記住！）<span class="star">🪤</span></div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 Learning Objectives Review — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有Trap類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂Mnemonic</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>排名</th><th>Trap</th><th>正確答案</th><th>來源</th></tr>
<tr><td>🏆 第1</td><td><strong>1.5小時 = 1小時50min</strong></td><td>0.5x60=30 → 1.5h=1h30m！</td><td>L32</td></tr>
<tr><td>🥈 第2</td><td><strong>餘數大過除數</strong></td><td>餘數必須&lt;除數！85÷6=14...1，唔係13...7</td><td>L22</td></tr>
<tr><td>🥉 第3</td><td><strong>分母相加</strong></td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>+<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>=<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>，唔係<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span>！分母不變！</td><td>L25</td></tr>
<tr><td>第4</td><td><strong>進位忘記加返</strong></td><td>乘完後要加返低位進上嚟嘅數字</td><td>L21</td></tr>
<tr><td>第5</td><td><strong>先加減後乘除</strong></td><td>5+3x4=17（先乘3x4=12，再加5），唔係32</td><td>L24</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、暑假練習包（保持數學頭腦！）<span class="star">📝</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">暑假目標：唔好俾數學生鏽！每日 15 min就夠！</div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>每週任務（共 8 週）：</strong><br/>
① <strong>週一：</strong>3 題Multiplication（三位數x一位數）+ 3 題Division（兩位數÷一位數有餘數）<br/>
② <strong>週二：</strong>5 題四則混合（注意先乘除後加減！）<br/>
③ <strong>週三：</strong>5 題Fraction加減（同分母）+ 2 題Fraction應用<br/>
④ <strong>週四：</strong>5 題Decimal和容量轉換（L和mL）<br/>
⑤ <strong>週五：</strong>3 題時間計算 + 閱讀/畫一張棒形圖<br/>
⑥ <strong>週末：</strong>趣味挑戰題 2-3 題（睇下面！）<br/>
⑦ <strong>每日必做：</strong>背一次 1-10 Multiplication表（2min內完成！）<br/>
⑧ <strong>每週筆記：</strong>寫低你遇到嘅Trap同你點避開佢！
</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">暑假趣味挑戰題（共 8 題 — 每週一題）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">週</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>🔢 用 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 組成最大嘅三位數乘一位數（例如 543x2），令結果最大。試下唔同組合！</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>🍕 一個 Pizza 切 12 件。家人吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span>，你吃了 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span>。總共吃了幾分之幾？剩幾分之幾？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>⏰ 記錄你一星期每天的睡覺和起床時間，計算每日睡了多久。哪日睡最多？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>📊 訪問 5 個人，問他們最喜歡的雪糕口味。記錄數據，畫棒形圖。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>🪤 設計 3 題「Trap題」考你嘅朋友/家人，每題要包含一個 P3 Trap。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>📦 搵出屋企 5 樣3D Solid物件，分類為柱體/錐體/球體，數出面、棱、頂點的數量。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>🗺️ 畫出由你屋企到最近公園/商場/圖書館的路線圖，用方向（東南西北）標示路線。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>🎲 同朋友玩擲骰仔遊戲：擲兩粒骰，記錄 30 次的結果。邊個總和最常出現？點解？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">五、升 P4 預告：你會學到咩？<span class="star">🔮</span></div>
<div class="preview-grid">
<div class="preview-card">
<div class="title">P4 上學期·數</div>
<div class="desc">
<strong>五位數：</strong>萬位、十萬位<br/>
<strong>大數Estimation：</strong>四捨五入到千位<br/>
<strong>Multiple和Factor：</strong>全新概念！<br/>
<strong>Divisible性：</strong>2,5,10的Multiple規律<br/>
<strong>Fraction進階：</strong>異分母加減（要通分！）<br/>
<strong>Decimal進階：</strong>百分位（0.01）·加減
</div>
</div>
<div class="preview-card">
<div class="title">P4 上學期·圖形與度量</div>
<div class="desc">
<strong>Perimeter：</strong>Square、RectanglePerimeter<br/>
<strong>Area初探：</strong>數格仔求Area<br/>
<strong>ParallelogramArea：</strong>底x高<br/>
<strong>TriangleArea：</strong>底x高÷2<br/>
<strong>四邊形分類：</strong>Parallelogram、Rhombus、Trapezoid<br/>
<strong>棒形圖進階：</strong>一格=5,10,20,50,100
</div>
</div>
<div class="preview-card">
<div class="title">P4 上學期·應用</div>
<div class="desc">
<strong>Multiplication進階：</strong>兩位數x兩位數<br/>
<strong>Division進階：</strong>三位數÷兩位數<br/>
<strong>四則Word Problems：</strong>多步運算<br/>
<strong>時間進階：</strong>24小時制·時間表<br/>
<strong>象形圖：</strong>用圖案表示數據<br/>
<strong>Equation入門：</strong>簡單代數（用符號代表數）
</div>
</div>
<div class="preview-card">
<div class="title">P4 vs P3：最大分別</div>
<div class="desc">
<strong>數值更大：</strong>由三位數擴展到五位數<br/>
<strong>計算更複雜：</strong>兩位數Multiplication、除數係兩位數<br/>
<strong>概念更抽象：</strong>Factor、Multiple、Area<br/>
<strong>Word Problems更多步：</strong>需要2-3步計算<br/>
<strong>圖形更多：</strong>各種四邊形、Symmetry進階<br/>
<strong>P3基礎 = P4成功！</strong>打好P3根基最重要！
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-h1">六、暑假 P4 準備清單</div>
<div class="check-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin:8px 0;font-size:13px;">
<div style="background:#DCFCE7;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ Multiplication表滾瓜爛熟（1-10）</div>
<div style="background:#DCFCE7;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ 三位數x一位數熟練</div>
<div style="background:#DBEAFE;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ 兩位數÷一位數（有餘數）熟練</div>
<div style="background:#DBEAFE;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ 四則混合次序正確</div>
<div style="background:#FEF3C7;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ 同分母Fraction加減熟練</div>
<div style="background:#FEF3C7;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ Decimal十分位理解</div>
<div style="background:#F3E8FF;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ 1L=1000mL · 時間60進制</div>
<div style="background:#F3E8FF;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ 棒形圖閱讀+製作</div>
<div style="background:#FCE7F3;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ 3D Solid面棱頂點 · Symmetry軸</div>
<div style="background:#FCE7F3;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;">✅ 心算策略 · Estimation驗證</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0;">
🌟 老師的話：<br/>
你已經完成咗小三下學期，由Multiplication進階到可能性入門，你學咗好多嘢！<br/>
記住：數學唔係死記公式，而係學識<strong>避開Trap</strong>！<br/>
暑假記住做練習包，保持數學頭腦活躍！<br/>
九月見！P4 我哋一齊征服新挑戰！<br/>
<strong>你做得到！好叻呀！加油！</strong>💪🏆
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">七、學期終極測試（15 題 — 綜合所有課題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>347 x 3 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>82 ÷ 6 = ？商 = ＿＿，餘 = ＿＿</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>47 粒糖，每 6 粒一盒。要全部裝晒，要幾多盒？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>9 + 4 x 8 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">6</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> = ＿＿（假Fraction+帶Fraction）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>30 個學生嘅 <span class="f"><span class="n">4</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> = ＿＿人</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>0.8 = <span class="f"><span class="n">?</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">?</span></span>   0.4 + 0.3 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>棒形圖一格=2。棒高7格 = ＿＿</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>3 L = ＿＿ mL   4500 mL = ＿＿ L</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>1.5 小時 = ＿＿ min（唔好寫錯！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>9:15 + 2 小時 50 min = ＿＿：＿＿</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>長方體有＿＿面、＿＿棱、＿＿頂點。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>Square有＿＿條Symmetry軸。Rectangle有＿＿條。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>面向北，向右轉一次 = 面向＿＿。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>盒有 8 紅 2 藍。閉眼抽一粒。抽到紅色係：一定 / 可能 / 不可能？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">八、終極Mnemonic大全</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 「進位要加返，餘數細過除數，分母唔會加，先乘除後加減，1.5h=90min，Circle柱唔係Circle錐，Symmetry軸可多過一條，可能唔等於一定！」</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">暑假</div><div class="d">每日15min練習</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">重溫</div><div class="d">P3Trap筆記</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">準備</div><div class="d">P4預習內容</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">享受</div><div class="d">暑假！你值得！</div></div>
